; Reuses ../Foo.ml as-is via copy_files (a build-time rule, not a
; committed duplicate/symlink), so the exact same backend-agnostic source
; runs against elm_playground_software here and elm_playground_native
; (Cairo) in ../dune -- compare e.g.
;   dune exec examples/Picture.exe
;   dune exec examples/software/Picture.exe
(copy_files ../*.ml)

